-- ============================================================
-- Razent — Seed data: 2 demo merchants + 12 grocery products +
-- 5 orders + 4 conversations + 5 audit sessions.
--
-- Why this file exists: the PR 3 client.ts is Supabase-only, so the
-- DB must have at least one merchant + a few products for the
-- merchant dashboard to render anything other than empty states.
--
-- Demo users (created via the auth.users insert in supabase bootstrap;
-- the handle_new_user trigger auto-creates the profiles row):
--   demo@razent.local      (super_admin, password: demo-password-1234)
--   merchant1@razent.local (merchant,    password: demo-password-1234)
--
-- After this migration runs, sign in at /sign-in with either email
-- and the password above to see the demo dashboard.
--
-- Q15a: Grocery vertical (Blinkit/Zepto style — fresh produce,
-- dairy, snacks, beverages, household).
-- ============================================================

-- Note: the auth.users insert is split out of this file because it
-- requires service_role and is one-time only. Run it once via the
-- Supabase SQL editor as a postgres user, or use the
-- bootstrap-demo-users helper (scripts/bootstrap-demo-users.mjs).
-- See supabase/README.md for the exact one-liner.

